    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misha is searching for Dima.</strong> He must scour a fictional world\u00a0<strong>(CHECK 233 / 236 PLACES)</strong> whose landscapes vaguely resemble areas around major Eastern European cities in the early 21st century\u2014reimagined in a humorous alternate reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIMAWORLD IS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic visuals, cutscenes, and immersive sound design  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player open-world experience, offering several hours of gameplay packed with diverse elements: large-scale events, occurrences of natural phenomena, and unexpected encounters. You\u2019ll interact with various physical objects and entities, robots, and weapons\u2014purchasing and using them, and pursuing additional tasks along the way.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control different vehicles, ride trains, and survive in third-person perspective, confronting humans, wild animals, robots, and even mutant monsters.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fictional world with a slightly comical atmosphere of an early 21st-century alternate reality.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An indie open-world explorer with elements of survival, action, object searching, and an intriguing storyline.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286220/extras/3b72735915b292c2c0535f950c80bf3d.avif?t=1741708490\" data-has-big width=800 height=698 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misha is searching for Dima.</strong> He must scour a fictional world\u00a0<strong>(CHECK 233 / 236 PLACES)</strong> whose landscapes vaguely resemble areas around major Eastern European cities in the early 21st century\u2014reimagined in a humorous alternate reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIMAWORLD IS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic visuals, cutscenes, and immersive sound design  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player open-world experience, offering several hours of gameplay packed with diverse elements: large-scale events, occurrences of natural phenomena, and unexpected encounters. You\u2019ll interact with various physical objects and entities, robots, and weapons\u2014purchasing and using them, and pursuing additional tasks along the way.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control different vehicles, ride trains, and survive in third-person perspective, confronting humans, wild animals, robots, and even mutant monsters.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fictional world with a slightly comical atmosphere of an early 21st-century alternate reality.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An indie open-world explorer with elements of survival, action, object searching, and an intriguing storyline.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286220/extras/3b72735915b292c2c0535f950c80bf3d.avif?t=1741708490\" data-has-big width=800 height=698 /></span></p></li></ul>",
